# Commit mesajlari

- Tek satir, kisa: `fix: grafana panel grid`, `chore: scoop hash`
- Ne degisti yaz; neden harika / ne temizlendi anlatma
- AI metni, em dash, template, prose, normalize, leftover gibi meta kelimeleri commit mesajinda kullanma
- AI veya pazarlama metni sildiginde commit mesajinda hic bahsetme; normal fix/chore gibi yaz

## Ornek

```
fix: winget installer hash
chore: grafana tests
fix: comment dashes in grafana.rs
```

Yasak:

```
chore: remove AI-generated prose and template leftovers from README
chore: add no-emdash rule and normalize arrow comments in docs
fix: normalize comment dashes in models and grafana engine (removed em dashes)
```

Body ve bullet list kullanma; repo stili tek satirlik subject.
